OL,3,GNEWSA#1m illegal tip clean-up costs
OL,4,Astill not repaid two years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo years after a major fire triggered
OL,7,Fan investigation into an illegal waste
OL,8,Fsite, no-one has been held accountable
OL,9,Ffor the #1m clean-up operation.
OL,11,FFlintshire council paid for remedial
OL,12,Fwork at the site on Riverside Way,
OL,13,FQueensferry, which became an unlicensed
OL,14,Frubbish tip - with 1,200 tonnes of
OL,15,Fwaste deposited on it.
OL,17,FAfter a huge fire tore through the site
OL,18,Fin November 2024, the local authority
OL,19,Fvowed to recover the cost from whoever
OL,20,Fwas responsible.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
